        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Capricorn &mdash; 1st (Signature) Technique, gained at level 1.</em></p><p><em>Your arm is the sword. You have simply stopped pretending otherwise.</em></p><p>Until the end of your turn, your unarmed Strikes deal <strong>slashing</strong> damage, gain the <strong>deadly d10</strong> trait, and ignore Hardness.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> At 10th level the deadly die becomes d12. At 14th and 18th level, your Strikes deal an additional 1d6 slashing damage.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
